{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.koito.studio",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "第一次进摄影棚",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.koito.studio",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.koito.studio",
    "idolId": "koito",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "……好、好厉害…………",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "ぴぇ……！啊，早、早上好……！",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "请、请多指教……！",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "辛、辛苦了……！",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "……………………！",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈，小糸不用那么紧张也没关系。",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "我、我不是想紧张才紧张的……！",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊哈哈，那倒也是。",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不过，你可以有自信。小糸是被选中才站在这里的。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这份工作，是小糸在甄选里抓住的。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "………………！",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "第一次来拍摄现场的时候，我也吓了一跳。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "原来是这样的啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "是、是这样吧……！",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "我、我在化妆间也吓了一跳……！",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "化妆师那个……像宝箱一样的东西里",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "闪闪发光的化妆工具一直往外冒……！",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "摄影棚也特别晃眼，大人好多……",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "这样的景色，我从来没见过，也不知道……",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……嗯。",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "所、所以也从来没想象过。",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "到现在为止，一次也没有梦到过。",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……这样啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "不过……以后每天，一定会梦到的。",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "和制作人先生在一起，尽是第一次的事，全都像梦一样。",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……不是梦吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "────啊……！",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……嗯？怎么了小糸？",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "要是捏一下，梦就会醒，所以我在保护它们，脸颊！",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………！",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……哈哈，没事没事，不是梦。",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "不、不行的……！我、我不会让你捏的……！"
      }
    }
  },
